  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ugo filius Adalberti dat Lotario filio Gualterii terram arabilem in loco qui dicitur Collis, et accipit in commutatione vineam in loco qui dicitur Rivus Frigidus, utraque parte consentiente et laudante.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis ex partibus hanc commutationem rescindere temptaverit, poenam dupli valoris rerum commutatarum persolvat et carta ista in suo robore permaneat.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness>
          <name>Rolandus de Squarcialupis</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Gratianus filius Petri</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Malapresa de Ugurgieri</name>
        </witness>
      </listWitness>
